NAME:
   isupipebench - isupipe ベンチマーカー

USAGE:
   isupipebench [global options] command [command options] [arguments...]

VERSION:
   0.0.0

DESCRIPTION:
   isupipeのベンチマークを実施

COMMANDS:
     run       ベンチマーク実行
     supervise
     help, h   Shows a list of commands or help for one command

GLOBAL OPTIONS:
   --help, -h  show help
